{"id":"862e90e247cd0b02","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/755_RDF_Schema_RDFS.md","title":"755 RDF Schema RDFS","display":"755_RDF_Schema_RDFS","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"755-RDF-Schema-RDFS\">755 RDF Schema RDFS</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-RDF-名字与保留词\">1. RDF 名字与保留词</h1>\n<p>本文件约定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,L,B\">\\(U,L,B\\)</span> 两两不交且可数无穷。</p>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(U,L,B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma=(U,L,B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 是 IRI 集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 是字面量集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 是空白节点集，三者两两不交且可数。</p>\n<p>项、主语与宾语载体为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}=U\\cup L\\cup B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Term}=U\\cup L\\cup B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subj}=U\\cup L\\cup B=\\mathsf{Term},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Obj}=U\\cup L\\cup B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subj}=U\\cup L\\cup B=\\mathsf{Term},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Obj}=U\\cup L\\cup B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本条目固定为 <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/2014/REC-rdf11-mt-20140225/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">RDF 1.1 Semantics（2014），§8–9及附录A</a> 中上述九个保留词的显式规则闭包片段：类/属性位置按 IRI 规则参数读取，空白节点按本地名字处理，不加入容器、集合、reification、外部数据类型识别或一般空白节点存在匹配，故不宣称完整 RDFS 模型后承。该片段包含下列基础公理及十二类规则。本条目采用允许字面量出现在推导结论主语位置的广义 RDFS 三元组载体；输入图仍可限制为不含字面量主语的普通 RDF 子载体。该选择使值域规则能够把字面量对象显式类型化。</p>\n<p>构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{triple}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{triple}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{triple}:\\mathsf{Subj}\\times U\\times\\mathsf{Obj}\\to\\mathsf{Trip}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{triple}:\\mathsf{Subj}\\times U\\times\\mathsf{Obj}\\to\\mathsf{Trip}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{triple}(s,p,o)\">\\(\\operatorname{triple}(s,p,o)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(s,o)\">\\(p(s,o)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>固定下列保留 IRI 均属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rdf:type},\\operatorname{rdf:Property},\\operatorname{rdfs:Class},\\operatorname{rdfs:Resource},\\operatorname{rdfs:Literal},\n\\operatorname{rdfs:subClassOf},\\operatorname{rdfs:subPropertyOf},\\operatorname{rdfs:domain},\\operatorname{rdfs:range}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rdf:type},\\operatorname{rdf:Property},\\operatorname{rdfs:Class},\\operatorname{rdfs:Resource},\\operatorname{rdfs:Literal},\n\\operatorname{rdfs:subClassOf},\\operatorname{rdfs:subPropertyOf},\\operatorname{rdfs:domain},\\operatorname{rdfs:range}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-三元组与图\">2. 三元组与图</h1>\n<p>RDF 三元组集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Trip}\">\\(\\mathsf{Trip}\\)</span> 是满足下列形成条款的最小集合：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathsf{Subj}\">\\(s\\in\\mathsf{Subj}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\\in\\mathsf{Obj}\">\\(o\\in\\mathsf{Obj}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in U\">\\(p\\in U\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s,p,o)\\in\\mathsf{Trip}\">\\((s,p,o)\\in\\mathsf{Trip}\\)</span>。等价地：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Trip}=\\mathsf{Subj}\\times U\\times\\mathsf{Obj}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Trip}=\\mathsf{Subj}\\times U\\times\\mathsf{Obj}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s,p,o)\">\\((s,p,o)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(s,o)\">\\(p(s,o)\\)</span>。RDFS 图是有限集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Trip}\">\\(G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Trip}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>句子集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sent}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Sent}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\\)</span> 是由三元组注入条款生成的最小集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sent}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}=\\mathsf{Trip}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Sent}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}=\\mathsf{Trip}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-自由名字与替换\">3. 自由名字与替换</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Name}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}=\\mathsf{Term}\">\\(\\mathsf{Name}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}=\\mathsf{Term}\\)</span>，固定枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathsf{Term}\">\\(e_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathsf{Term}\\)</span>。对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Term}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Term}\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}(X)=e_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}(m),\n\\qquad\nm=\\min\\{i:e_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}(i)\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}(X)=e_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}(m),\n\\qquad\nm=\\min\\{i:e_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}(i)\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定名字函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Trip}\\cup\\mathsf{Sent}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Term}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(X)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Trip}\\cup\\mathsf{Sent}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Term}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(X)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}:\\mathsf{Trip}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Term})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}:\\mathsf{Trip}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Term})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(p(s,o))=\\{s,p,o\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(p(s,o))=\\{s,p,o\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{Term}\\to\\mathsf{Term}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{Term}\\to\\mathsf{Term}\\)</span> 是有限支撑函数，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(U)\\subseteq U\">\\(\\sigma(U)\\subseteq U\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(L)\\subseteq L\">\\(\\sigma(L)\\subseteq L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(B)\\subseteq B\">\\(\\sigma(B)\\subseteq B\\)</span>，且固定第 1 节所有保留 IRI。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(p(s,o))=\\sigma(p)(\\sigma(s),\\sigma(o)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma(p(s,o))=\\sigma(p)(\\sigma(s),\\sigma(o)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义替换族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\sigma}:\\sigma\\text{ 满足本节替换条件}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\sigma}:\\sigma\\text{ 满足本节替换条件}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\sigma}(p(s,o))=\\sigma(p)(\\sigma(s),\\sigma(o)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\sigma}(p(s,o))=\\sigma(p)(\\sigma(s),\\sigma(o)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>没有绑定项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}(t)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BN}(t)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。定义系统内 alpha 等价关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\n=\n\\{(X,X):X\\in\\mathsf{Trip}\\cup\\mathsf{Sent}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\n=\n\\{(X,X):X\\in\\mathsf{Trip}\\cup\\mathsf{Sent}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此捕获避免条件为空条件，名字重命名完全由下面的保持种类替换函数给出。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-RDFS-公理\">4. RDFS 公理</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}(G)=G\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{vocab}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{base}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}(G)=G\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{vocab}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{base}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{vocab}=\n\\{\\operatorname{rdf:type}(\\operatorname{rdf:Property},\\operatorname{rdfs:Class}),\n\\operatorname{rdf:type}(\\operatorname{rdfs:Class},\\operatorname{rdfs:Class}),\n\\operatorname{rdf:type}(\\operatorname{rdfs:Resource},\\operatorname{rdfs:Class}),\n\\operatorname{rdf:type}(\\operatorname{rdfs:Literal},\\operatorname{rdfs:Class})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{vocab}=\n\\{\\operatorname{rdf:type}(\\operatorname{rdf:Property},\\operatorname{rdfs:Class}),\n\\operatorname{rdf:type}(\\operatorname{rdfs:Class},\\operatorname{rdfs:Class}),\n\\operatorname{rdf:type}(\\operatorname{rdfs:Resource},\\operatorname{rdfs:Class}),\n\\operatorname{rdf:type}(\\operatorname{rdfs:Literal},\\operatorname{rdfs:Class})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{base}=\\{\\operatorname{rdf:type}(u,\\operatorname{rdfs:Resource}):u\\in U\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{rdf:type}(p,\\operatorname{rdf:Property}):p\\in V_P\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{rdfs:domain}(p,c),\\operatorname{rdfs:range}(p,d):(p,c,d)\\in V_{dr}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{base}=\\{\\operatorname{rdf:type}(u,\\operatorname{rdfs:Resource}):u\\in U\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{rdf:type}(p,\\operatorname{rdf:Property}):p\\in V_P\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{rdfs:domain}(p,c),\\operatorname{rdfs:range}(p,d):(p,c,d)\\in V_{dr}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这里两个固定有限表为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_P=\\{\\operatorname{rdf:type},\\operatorname{rdfs:subClassOf},\\operatorname{rdfs:subPropertyOf},\\operatorname{rdfs:domain},\\operatorname{rdfs:range}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_P=\\{\\operatorname{rdf:type},\\operatorname{rdfs:subClassOf},\\operatorname{rdfs:subPropertyOf},\\operatorname{rdfs:domain},\\operatorname{rdfs:range}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_{dr}=\\{(\\operatorname{rdf:type},\\operatorname{rdfs:Resource},\\operatorname{rdfs:Class}),\n(\\operatorname{rdfs:subClassOf},\\operatorname{rdfs:Class},\\operatorname{rdfs:Class}),\n(\\operatorname{rdfs:subPropertyOf},\\operatorname{rdf:Property},\\operatorname{rdf:Property}),\n(\\operatorname{rdfs:domain},\\operatorname{rdf:Property},\\operatorname{rdfs:Class}),\n(\\operatorname{rdfs:range},\\operatorname{rdf:Property},\\operatorname{rdfs:Class})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_{dr}=\\{(\\operatorname{rdf:type},\\operatorname{rdfs:Resource},\\operatorname{rdfs:Class}),\n(\\operatorname{rdfs:subClassOf},\\operatorname{rdfs:Class},\\operatorname{rdfs:Class}),\n(\\operatorname{rdfs:subPropertyOf},\\operatorname{rdf:Property},\\operatorname{rdf:Property}),\n(\\operatorname{rdfs:domain},\\operatorname{rdf:Property},\\operatorname{rdfs:Class}),\n(\\operatorname{rdfs:range},\\operatorname{rdf:Property},\\operatorname{rdfs:Class})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-RDFS-规则\">5. RDFS 规则</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\\)</span> 为下列关系的并。</p>\n<p>子属性传递：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{spT}=\\{(((\\operatorname{rdfs:subPropertyOf}(p,q)),(\\operatorname{rdfs:subPropertyOf}(q,r))),\\operatorname{rdfs:subPropertyOf}(p,r)):p,q,r\\in U\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{spT}=\\{(((\\operatorname{rdfs:subPropertyOf}(p,q)),(\\operatorname{rdfs:subPropertyOf}(q,r))),\\operatorname{rdfs:subPropertyOf}(p,r)):p,q,r\\in U\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>子属性实例提升：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{spI}=\\{(((p(s,o)),(\\operatorname{rdfs:subPropertyOf}(p,q))),q(s,o)):s\\in\\mathsf{Subj},o\\in\\mathsf{Obj},p,q\\in U\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{spI}=\\{(((p(s,o)),(\\operatorname{rdfs:subPropertyOf}(p,q))),q(s,o)):s\\in\\mathsf{Subj},o\\in\\mathsf{Obj},p,q\\in U\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>子类传递：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{scT}=\\{(((\\operatorname{rdfs:subClassOf}(c,d)),(\\operatorname{rdfs:subClassOf}(d,e))),\\operatorname{rdfs:subClassOf}(c,e)):c,d,e\\in U\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{scT}=\\{(((\\operatorname{rdfs:subClassOf}(c,d)),(\\operatorname{rdfs:subClassOf}(d,e))),\\operatorname{rdfs:subClassOf}(c,e)):c,d,e\\in U\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>类型沿子类提升：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{scI}=\\{(((\\operatorname{rdf:type}(x,c)),(\\operatorname{rdfs:subClassOf}(c,d))),\\operatorname{rdf:type}(x,d)):x\\in\\mathsf{Subj},c,d\\in U\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{scI}=\\{(((\\operatorname{rdf:type}(x,c)),(\\operatorname{rdfs:subClassOf}(c,d))),\\operatorname{rdf:type}(x,d)):x\\in\\mathsf{Subj},c,d\\in U\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义域：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{dom}=\\{(((p(s,o)),(\\operatorname{rdfs:domain}(p,c))),\\operatorname{rdf:type}(s,c)):s\\in\\mathsf{Subj},o\\in\\mathsf{Obj},p,c\\in U\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{dom}=\\{(((p(s,o)),(\\operatorname{rdfs:domain}(p,c))),\\operatorname{rdf:type}(s,c)):s\\in\\mathsf{Subj},o\\in\\mathsf{Obj},p,c\\in U\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>值域：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{rng}=\\{(((p(s,o)),(\\operatorname{rdfs:range}(p,c))),\\operatorname{rdf:type}(o,c)):s\\in\\mathsf{Subj},o\\in\\mathsf{Obj},p,c\\in U\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{rng}=\\{(((p(s,o)),(\\operatorname{rdfs:range}(p,c))),\\operatorname{rdf:type}(o,c)):s\\in\\mathsf{Subj},o\\in\\mathsf{Obj},p,c\\in U\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>资源类型：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{resS}\n=\n\\{(((p(s,o))),\\operatorname{rdf:type}(s,\\operatorname{rdfs:Resource})):\ns\\in\\mathsf{Subj},o\\in\\mathsf{Obj},p\\in U\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{resS}\n=\n\\{(((p(s,o))),\\operatorname{rdf:type}(s,\\operatorname{rdfs:Resource})):\ns\\in\\mathsf{Subj},o\\in\\mathsf{Obj},p\\in U\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{resO}\n=\n\\{(((p(s,o))),\\operatorname{rdf:type}(o,\\operatorname{rdfs:Resource})):\ns\\in\\mathsf{Subj},o\\in\\mathsf{Obj},p\\in U\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{resO}\n=\n\\{(((p(s,o))),\\operatorname{rdf:type}(o,\\operatorname{rdfs:Resource})):\ns\\in\\mathsf{Subj},o\\in\\mathsf{Obj},p\\in U\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>基础类型与反身性规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{prop}=\\{((p(s,o)),\\operatorname{rdf:type}(p,\\operatorname{rdf:Property})):p\\in U,s,o\\in\\mathsf{Term}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{prop}=\\{((p(s,o)),\\operatorname{rdf:type}(p,\\operatorname{rdf:Property})):p\\in U,s,o\\in\\mathsf{Term}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{spRefl}=\\{((\\operatorname{rdf:type}(p,\\operatorname{rdf:Property})),\\operatorname{rdfs:subPropertyOf}(p,p)):p\\in U\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{spRefl}=\\{((\\operatorname{rdf:type}(p,\\operatorname{rdf:Property})),\\operatorname{rdfs:subPropertyOf}(p,p)):p\\in U\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{classRes}=\\{((\\operatorname{rdf:type}(c,\\operatorname{rdfs:Class})),\\operatorname{rdfs:subClassOf}(c,\\operatorname{rdfs:Resource})):c\\in U\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{classRes}=\\{((\\operatorname{rdf:type}(c,\\operatorname{rdfs:Class})),\\operatorname{rdfs:subClassOf}(c,\\operatorname{rdfs:Resource})):c\\in U\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{scRefl}=\\{((\\operatorname{rdf:type}(c,\\operatorname{rdfs:Class})),\\operatorname{rdfs:subClassOf}(c,c)):c\\in U\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{scRefl}=\\{((\\operatorname{rdf:type}(c,\\operatorname{rdfs:Class})),\\operatorname{rdfs:subClassOf}(c,c)):c\\in U\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{spT}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{spI}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{scT}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{scI}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{dom}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{rng}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{resS}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{resO}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{prop}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{spRefl}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{classRes}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{scRefl}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{spT}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{spI}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{scT}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{scI}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{dom}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{rng}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{resS}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{resO}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{prop}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{spRefl}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{classRes}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{scRefl}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的 RDFS 证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=(\\varphi_0,\\ldots,\\varphi_{m-1})\">\\(p=(\\varphi_0,\\ldots,\\varphi_{m-1})\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_i\\in\\mathsf{Trip}\">\\(\\varphi_i\\in\\mathsf{Trip}\\)</span>，末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<p>以下第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> 个条件逐一、分别定义谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\ell(G,p,i)\">\\(L_\\ell(G,p,i)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\leq\\ell\\leq 13\">\\(1\\leq\\ell\\leq 13\\)</span>）；每行至少满足其中一个条件。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}(G)\">\\(\\varphi_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}(G)\\)</span>；</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\varphi_j,\\varphi_k),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{spT}\">\\(((\\varphi_j,\\varphi_k),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{spT}\\)</span>；</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\varphi_j,\\varphi_k),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{spI}\">\\(((\\varphi_j,\\varphi_k),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{spI}\\)</span>；</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\varphi_j,\\varphi_k),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{scT}\">\\(((\\varphi_j,\\varphi_k),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{scT}\\)</span>；</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\varphi_j,\\varphi_k),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{scI}\">\\(((\\varphi_j,\\varphi_k),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{scI}\\)</span>；</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\varphi_j,\\varphi_k),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{dom}\">\\(((\\varphi_j,\\varphi_k),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{dom}\\)</span>；</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\varphi_j,\\varphi_k),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{rng}\">\\(((\\varphi_j,\\varphi_k),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{rng}\\)</span>；</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\varphi_j),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{resS}\">\\(((\\varphi_j),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{resS}\\)</span>；</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\varphi_j),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{resO}\">\\(((\\varphi_j),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{resO}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\varphi_j),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{prop}\">\\(((\\varphi_j),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{prop}\\)</span>；</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\varphi_j),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{spRefl}\">\\(((\\varphi_j),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{spRefl}\\)</span>；</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\varphi_j),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{classRes}\">\\(((\\varphi_j),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{classRes}\\)</span>；</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\varphi_j),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{scRefl}\">\\(((\\varphi_j),\\varphi_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{scRefl}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义行许可的唯一组合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}(G,p,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow \\bigvee_{\\ell=1}^{13} L_\\ell(G,p,i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LineOK}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}(G,p,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow \\bigvee_{\\ell=1}^{13} L_\\ell(G,p,i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本节的证明条件是对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 都有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}(G,p,i)\">\\(\\operatorname{LineOK}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}(G,p,i)\\)</span>；本节定义的证明对象、证明谓词及可导出关系均采用此条件。序列须非空、有限且逐行有型；末项条件和各分支的严格早索引条件同时保留。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可导出关系\">7. 可导出关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\\varphi\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G\\vdash_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\\varphi\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的 RDFS 证明。</p>\n<p>定义证明谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}(G,p,\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}(G,p,\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 是满足第 6 节十三类行条件且末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的非空有限序列。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-闭包结构与后承\">8. 闭包结构与后承</h1>\n<p>定义知识库载体：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{KB}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}=\\{G:G\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{Trip}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{KB}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}=\\{G:G\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{Trip}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义闭包结构集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Trip}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Trip}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\">\\(X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\\)</span> 定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\models_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\\varphi\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\models_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\\varphi\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in X\">\\(\\varphi\\in X\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}(G,X)\">\\(\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}(G,X)\\)</span> 当且仅当：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}(G)\\subseteq X\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}(G)\\subseteq X\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\psi_0,\\ldots,\\psi_{\\ell-1}),\\chi)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\">\\(((\\psi_0,\\ldots,\\psi_{\\ell-1}),\\chi)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_i\\in X\">\\(\\psi_i\\in X\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;\\ell\">\\(i&lt;\\ell\\)</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\\in X\">\\(\\chi\\in X\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>语义后承定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G\\Vdash_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\\varphi\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G\\Vdash_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\\varphi\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\">\\(X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}(G,X)\">\\(\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}(G,X)\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\models_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\models_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-特征差异\">9. 特征差异</h1>\n<p>定义 RDFS 规则族索引集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak R_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\n=\n\\{\\mathsf{Rule}_{spT},\\mathsf{Rule}_{spI},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{scT},\\mathsf{Rule}_{scI},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{dom},\\mathsf{Rule}_{rng},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{resS},\\mathsf{Rule}_{resO},\\mathsf{Rule}_{prop},\\mathsf{Rule}_{spRefl},\\mathsf{Rule}_{classRes},\\mathsf{Rule}_{scRefl}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak R_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\n=\n\\{\\mathsf{Rule}_{spT},\\mathsf{Rule}_{spI},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{scT},\\mathsf{Rule}_{scI},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{dom},\\mathsf{Rule}_{rng},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{resS},\\mathsf{Rule}_{resO},\\mathsf{Rule}_{prop},\\mathsf{Rule}_{spRefl},\\mathsf{Rule}_{classRes},\\mathsf{Rule}_{scRefl}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>RDFS 的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Subj},U,\\mathsf{Obj},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{vocab},\\mathsf{Ax}_{base},\\mathfrak R_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Subj},U,\\mathsf{Obj},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{vocab},\\mathsf{Ax}_{base},\\mathfrak R_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该对象明确记录 RDF 三元组的三个位置 sort、RDFS 保留词及基础公理与十二个闭包规则；OWL 类表达式、等同个体规则和属性特征规则不属于本系统构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个形式系统\">10. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\n=\n(\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Term},\\mathsf{Subj},\\mathsf{Obj},\\mathsf{Trip},\\mathsf{Sent}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\n\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\n\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{base},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{spT},\\mathsf{Rule}_{spI},\\mathsf{Rule}_{scT},\\mathsf{Rule}_{scI},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{dom},\\mathsf{Rule}_{rng},\\mathsf{Rule}_{resS},\\mathsf{Rule}_{resO},\n\\mathfrak R_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\\vdash_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\n\\mathsf{KB}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\\models_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\n\\Vdash_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}\n=\n(\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Term},\\mathsf{Subj},\\mathsf{Obj},\\mathsf{Trip},\\mathsf{Sent}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\n\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\n\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{base},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{spT},\\mathsf{Rule}_{spI},\\mathsf{Rule}_{scT},\\mathsf{Rule}_{scI},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{dom},\\mathsf{Rule}_{rng},\\mathsf{Rule}_{resS},\\mathsf{Rule}_{resO},\n\\mathfrak R_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\\vdash_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\n\\mathsf{KB}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\\mathsf{Str}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\\models_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\operatorname{RDFS}},\n\\Vdash_{\\operatorname{RDFS}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统完整列出广义 RDFS 三元组、保留词公理、十二个闭包规则、总规则关系、证明对象和闭包式后承；普通 RDF 输入图是其中不含字面量主语的子类，推导状态允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rdf:type}(\\ell,C)\">\\(\\operatorname{rdf:type}(\\ell,C)\\)</span> 以记录字面量的值域类型；不含 OWL 类表达式、等同个体规则、属性特征规则或外部 RDF 解析过程。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"755-RDF-Schema-RDFS","text":"755 RDF Schema RDFS","level":1},{"id":"1.-RDF-名字与保留词","text":"1. RDF 名字与保留词","level":1},{"id":"2.-三元组与图","text":"2. 三元组与图","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由名字与替换","text":"3. 自由名字与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-RDFS-公理","text":"4. RDFS 公理","level":1},{"id":"5.-RDFS-规则","text":"5. RDFS 规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可导出关系","text":"7. 可导出关系","level":1},{"id":"8.-闭包结构与后承","text":"8. 闭包结构与后承","level":1},{"id":"9.-特征差异","text":"9. 特征差异","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个形式系统","text":"10. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U,L,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=(U,L,B)","display":true},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Term}=U\\cup L\\cup B.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Subj}=U\\cup L\\cup B=\\mathsf{Term},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Obj}=U\\cup L\\cup B.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{triple}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{triple}:\\mathsf{Subj}\\times U\\times\\mathsf{Obj}\\to\\mathsf{Trip}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{triple}(s,p,o)","display":false},{"tex":"p(s,o)","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rdf:type},\\operatorname{rdf:Property},\\operator